# Styled directory listings for participant downloads on training.michael-buchholz.com.
# Place at the document root; applies to every course folder (topic-customer-YYMM) below.
# Requires AllowOverride Indexes FileInfo Options (or All).

Options +Indexes +IncludesNOEXEC

IndexOptions FancyIndexing HTMLTable SuppressHTMLPreamble SuppressIcon SuppressDescription SuppressColumnSorting IgnoreClient FoldersFirst VersionSort NameWidth=* Charset=UTF-8
IndexOrderDefault Ascending Name

HeaderName /_index/header.shtml
ReadmeName /_index/footer.shtml
IndexIgnore _index .??* *~

AddType text/html .shtml
AddOutputFilter INCLUDES .shtml

# The root is never listed: course folder names contain customer names and are
# only reachable by direct link. Visitors of the bare domain land on the training page.
RedirectMatch 302 ^/$ https://michael-buchholz.com/schulungen
